---
/** Slide 07 · The engine — corpus + agents make it tractable. */
---

<section data-slot="07" data-variant="ref-p1" class="deck-section">
  <span class="deck-kicker">07 / 10</span>

  <div>
    <p class="deck-eyebrow mb-3">The engine</p>
    <h2 class="deck-h2">
      Reverse-engineering is the strategy.
      <span class="deck-gradient">The corpus + agents are the engine.</span>
    </h2>
  </div>

  <div class="deck-grid mt-2" style="grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(230px, 1fr));">
    <div class="deck-card flex flex-col gap-2">
      <span class="deck-stat" style="font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.6vw, 3rem);">500+</span>
      <p style="color: var(--color-text-muted); font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.1vw, 1.2rem); line-height: 1.5; margin: 0;">documents across 57 funders in the reach-edu corpus, with per-strategy funding datasets.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="deck-card flex flex-col gap-2">
      <span class="deck-stat" style="font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.6vw, 3rem);">185+</span>
      <p style="color: var(--color-text-muted); font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.1vw, 1.2rem); line-height: 1.5; margin: 0;">sources in the hex-coded citation registry — every claim in every deck traceable.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="deck-card flex flex-col gap-2">
      <span class="deck-stat" style="font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.6vw, 3rem);">1 day</span>
      <p style="color: var(--color-text-muted); font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.1vw, 1.2rem); line-height: 1.5; margin: 0;">for the 84-gift landscape scan — the throughput proof of the agent operating doctrine.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p class="deck-lede mt-2" style="max-width: 68ch;">
    Studying many funders' footprints and pattern-matching at whale scale is
    tractable for a team of three — because the agents do the reading.
  </p>
</section>
